ets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies",{"_71":253},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx",{"_47":255,"_54":65,"_49":256,"_59":257,"_68":-7,"_11":258,"_69":259},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx","Configura y opera el DMS","Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_71":260},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_47":262,"_54":65,"_49":263,"_59":264,"_68":-7,"_11":265,"_69":266},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_71":267},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_47":269,"_54":65,"_49":270,"_59":271,"_68":-7,"_11":272,"_69":273},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_71":274},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_47":276,"_54":65,"_49":277,"_59":278,"_68":-7,"_11":279,"_69":280},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_71":281},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_47":283,"_54":65,"_49":284,"_59":285,"_68":-7,"_11":286,"_69":287},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_71":288},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",